  - m_Id: 5776446912053347
    m_Localized: "Bolb Si\xEAu Vi\u1EC7t"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405571
  - m_Id: 5776446912053348
    m_Localized: "Bolb t\xF4n th\u1EDD s\u1EF1 bu\u1ED3n ch\xE1n v\xE0 l\u01B0\u1EDDi
      bi\u1EBFng, r\u1ED3i t\u1EADn d\u1EE5ng ch\xEDnh hai \u0111\u1EB7c t\xEDnh
      \u1EA5y \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh b\u1EADc th\u1EA7y ng\u1EE5y trang v\xE0
      b\u1EABy r\u1EADp. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt g\u1EB7p Bolb b\xEAn ngo\xE0i
      nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1EA7m l\u1EA7y quanh c\xE1c h\u1ED3 n\u01B0\u1EDBc um t\xF9m
      c\xE2y c\u1ECF, nh\u01B0ng chuy\u1EC7n \u0111\xF3 hi\u1EBFm l\u1EAFm. L\u0169
      sinh v\u1EADt n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 r\u1EDDi n\u01A1i \u1EDF khi \u0111\xE3 \u0111\xF3i
      su\u1ED1t \xEDt nh\u1EA5t hai tu\u1EA7n li\u1EC1n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405571
  - m_Id: 5776446912053349
    m_Localized: "Bolb <style=\"Blue\">H\u1ED3i</style> {Effect0.ValueInt} M\xE1u
      c\u1EE7a n\xF3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405571
  - m_Id: 5776446912053350
    m_Localized: "<style=\"Blue\">Ph\u1EA3n</style> {Effect1.AdditionalValueString}%
