  - m_Id: 5776446912053314
    m_Localized: "Fale Si\xEAu Vi\u1EC7t"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405571
  - m_Id: 5776446912053315
    m_Localized: "Fale th\xE2n thi\u1EC7n v\xE0 \u0111\xE1ng y\xEAu v\xF4 c\xF9ng.
      Ch\xFAng th\xEDch t\xE9 n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u1EDF v\xF9ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc n\xF4ng,
      l\u1EA1ch b\u1EA1ch d\u1EA1o b\xE3i bi\u1EC3n tr\xEAn \u0111\xF4i ch\xE2n ng\u1EAFn
      ng\u1EE7n v\xE0 l\u1EB7n c\xF9ng c\xE1c sinh v\u1EADt kh\xE1c. D\xF9 b\u1EC1
      ngo\xE0i nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy, Fale v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      hu\u1EA5n luy\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EC3 chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u. Ch\xFAng c\xF3
      th\u1EC3 l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng v\u1EC7 s\u0129 v\xE0 tr\u1EE3 th\u1EE7 d\u1EEF d\u1EB1n
      - v\xE0 ch\xFAng c\u1EF1c m\xEA ganh \u0111ua."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405571
  - m_Id: 5776446912053316
    m_Localized: "Fale <smallcaps><style=\"Blue\">K\xEDch ho\u1EA1t</style></smallcaps>
      t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 Mystling kh\xE1c"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8099901647879405571
  - m_Id: 5776446912053317
    m_Localized: "Fale <smallcaps><style=\"Blue\">H\u1ED3i Sinh</style></smallcaps>
